-- HENCE FOR EACH forks over the members of an EVERY; a single PARTY has no
-- members to fork over. PROVISIONAL R-Q1.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

alice MEANS Tenant OF "Alice"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    PARTY alice MUST Sign (EXACTLY alice) WITHIN 14 HENCE FOR EACH FULFILLED
